              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-47855",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-47855\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: net.sf.json-lib:json-lib\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2024-47855](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-47855)\nutil/JSONTokener.java in JSON-lib before 3.1.0 mishandles an unbalanced comment string.",
